      <div class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed space-y-4">
        <p>
          Software engineering is about designing fault-tolerant, scalable systems that can adapt to changing operational parameters. My current operations are focused on platform engineering, improving developer workflows, and automating cloud infrastructure.
        </p>
        <p>
