      <div class="bg-surface/30 border border-border p-6 md:p-8 relative">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-8 h-8 border-l border-b border-border bg-surface flex items-center justify-center text-text-muted text-[10px]">LRN</div>
        
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text uppercase tracking-widest mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-primary animate-pulse"></span> Active Learning
        </h3>
        <ul class="text-sm text-text-muted space-y-2 list-none">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-primary">›</span> Rust for high-performance microservices</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-primary">›</span> Advanced eBPF observability</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-primary">›</span> Distributed systems consensus algorithms</li>
